{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_chimes_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_chimes_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"落叶何归","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chimes_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"8e2c0e45d3ae3fab93bea39ab4d2f2ecc12048de6c09b3f37464660eb07f2062","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"铎铃，铎铃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，总算在你出城之前赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿云？怎么了，我有什么东西忘在邮局了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，是刚刚官府派人送来一封信，要送到石桥村。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"在邮局的信使没一个人听说过“石桥村”这个名字，相互打听了好一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"最后不知是谁说了一句“要是铎铃也不知道，那就没人知道了”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"正好你前脚刚走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，交给我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铎铃打开背囊，露出里面塞得满满当当的信件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把信放进来吧。石桥村这名字我听说过，知道大致方向，不过具体位置可能还得打听打听。我在送信的路上问清就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"这次你送完信是回玉门还是龙门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门。最近龙门积压的往山区寄的信件比玉门多多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"那等你送完信回来，我请你吃最近一直在做广告的辣椒老妈冰淇淋，据说是走香辣路线的，一点都不甜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可冰淇淋不该是甜的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿云","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，甜的吃腻了就吃点辣的，这就是流行嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"还是出城送信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，包就不查了。上次看你把那些信小心翼翼拿出来又整整齐齐塞回去，我都替你嫌麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，老张让我替他谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老张？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"就是自己老家镇子搬迁过一次，结果寄出去的信一直被退回邮局的那个大胡子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你替他把好几十封信一口气送到，他收了回信之后高兴得直流眼泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想起来了......其实没什么的，都是举手之劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那也得谢谢你。一路小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"在移动城市里待久了，人就容易忘了还有“外面”这回事。\n可“外面”其实真的很近，近到稍微往航道外走上几里路，人就会和风沙鼻子碰鼻子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，修驰道辛苦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"呦，这不是断角信使嘛！怎么，村里来信了？是给我的，还是给我们工地上哪个小姑娘小伙子的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确有信，不过是从龙门送来的津贴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"津贴啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像不太高兴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么会，出来干活不就是为了多赚几个钱改善生活嘛！我就是有点担心。村里上次来信已经是两个月前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上个月还路过你们村，大家都好得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你先别忙着走，留下吃顿晚饭，再住上一晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次要送的信还不少，要不我还是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"客气什么！就算没信大伙儿也喜欢你过来，听你讲移动城市里的事特别有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"正好今天又发了津贴，我让他们早点张罗饭，再找几个年轻人陪你聊天！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"下一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"出城办事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，办事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦把包开一下，安全检查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，有件事想问一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天中午是不是有个断了角的丰蹄信使出了城？她往哪边走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“见字......如面，我在龙门......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿芳，你认识字，过来帮我看看这说的是啥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是个什么东西，手电筒？家里有手电筒了，从龙门邮个这东西干啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"婶，那哪是手电筒，那是望远镜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是摄像机。我想拍一拍大家的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是能录电视的那个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......差不多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我可得好好捯饬捯饬......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"别人总说工作干久了人就会麻木，他们还说什么事都是这样，经历得多了就会习以为常。\n但我在大山和移动城市之间来来回回，送的最多的就是家书。\n这个月的家书和上个月的很难有什么区别，无非是雨多下了几天，麦子多收了几斗。\n但只要家还在，人们就还是会写一封又一封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，您知道石桥村怎么走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道它在北边，具体位置不太清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石桥村？我没什么印象。我在村里帮你问问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，我们也不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过据说边蹄村有个小伙子是从石桥村过去投靠亲戚的，他也许知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"边蹄村......正好，我也有信要送到那去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不多坐坐了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了。再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老乡，老乡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等会儿，你是谁呀，我怎么没见过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那位信使是不是说她要去石桥村？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒是没错——欸，你怎么又要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我家就在石桥村旁边，我去给她带路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石桥村来的......你是说阿良？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿良，快来，有人找你问路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往北，过北坟村十多里后，有一棵好几个人才能合抱的枯树，从那里进山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翻过去之后是一条人走出来的双岔路，向右一直走，走差不多一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我记住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么复杂，真亏你记得住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......向左走能走到我家乡的村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就说嘛，你这孩子看着就朴实，像我们山里出来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你家那边怎么样，还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经荒了。大家都搬进城做工去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，前几年年景不行，我们村也想过差不多的事，不过好歹挺过来了。你一路小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两位，刚才那个信使——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你找她有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想去石桥村，刚刚远远听你们说该怎么过去，可是没听清......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北坟村到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总共两封送到北坟村的信，还剩一封......就是要送去石桥村的那一封了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里怎么聚着好多人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家这是在......读公告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们村终于要搬了。有个新建的移动地块在招工，说是负责建筑的人等地块建好之后，可以继续在城里负责维护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不，公告已经贴出来了，过几天就有车队来接我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们的信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都给我吧，等大家各自回家了，我去把信给他们。多谢你这么多年一直给我们送信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你怎么还往北走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还剩一封寄到石桥村的信，我得送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石桥村？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石桥村上个月就说要搬，现在那边还有没有人都不好说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这消息确定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们要搬是板上钉钉的事，车队前几天也进山了。不过这几天我们没见有车队从山里出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就还赶得上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是别去了，那边路又远，又不知道他们还在不在，万一遭了贼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迫切的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多谢您的消息，我现在跑过去，应该还赶得上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕阳西下，狭窄的道路两侧，群山绵延开去。\n向北十余里，我见到那棵枯树，转了几个弯走进山中，翻山越岭，一路走到这个岔路口。\n我当年是从这里出来的，但现在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......各位，你们挡路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我们是来收信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我包里没有寄给你们的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不对吧？我可听说你包里的信是寄去石桥村的。石桥村就在前面，你把信给我，我送去村子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，软的不吃吃硬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"把信给我们。就一张纸片，别磨磨蹭蹭的，交出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要抢的话就来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"敢跟我们叫板，你翅膀硬了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们见过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"废话少说，这次老大不在，我们可不会手下留情！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"架势学得倒不错，就是不知道你刀头到底见没见过血......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"躲得还挺快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，这小妮子来真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么！咱们一起上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小妮子恁不懂事，一个破送信的罢了，拼什么命啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喘息）......我没什么可跟你们说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）老哥，对面还挺难拿下，要不咱们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）哼，也只能这么着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们各退一步好不好？我给你讲讲为什么我们要跟你过不去，你再好好想想跟我们拼命到底值不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己送的是谁的信吗？那是我们老大被抓之后寄出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"老大的老家就在石桥村，那个村子早就快荒得没人了。要不是你之前到处打听石桥村怎么走，我们也不可能盯上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁信你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们跟你打生打死，就为了一张不知道哪来的破纸片，我们至于吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"实话告诉你，被抓之前老大刚藏了一批金银细软，他好不容易从龙门寄出来这封信，里面肯定有名堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"把信交出来，等找到老大藏着的财宝，我们分你一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想都别想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，我再告诉你一件事，我们可是放过你一条生路的。那时候你角还没断呢，也还没背着背上这把刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"想起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......就是我遇到的第一伙盗匪？蒙着我的眼睛，烧了我的信的那一伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"还能有谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是老大不想惹麻烦，又看你一个没了家的小姑娘可怜，你以为杀个官差算多大点事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜......有什么可怜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你以为我们为什么觉得你可怜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"真正有能耐的大盗都在移动城市里干大买卖，我们要不是没了家，谁会来这种荒山野岭里劫道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"现在偏巧又是你给老大送这封信，咱们也算有缘。隔这么多年再见面，别闹得不好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）如果你们真觉得这算缘分，最好现在就让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么听不懂人话呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这把刀是我在被你们抢过之后才买的，别逼我真把它用在你们身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，兄弟们，小妮子自己找死，这可不怪咱们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"她在护着那个包！朝她背上砍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"反应倒快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......最好赶紧走。那两个人没受致命伤，还能救得起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的底已经给你交了，你不跟我们一起干，我们不可能放你活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小妮子，你腿都软了。乖乖把信交出来跟我们走，说不定还能赚一笔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想......想都别想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你看你，说话都不稳了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咕啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一刀，砍的是，胳膊......下一刀就不一定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，一个信使放倒了我们三个人。但你也就这样了。把刀放下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我说把刀放下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，还有帮手？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚣张的劫匪","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"撤，撤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没事。你又是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那封信......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铎铃往后退了一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风尘仆仆的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，着急了。这是我的证件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门近卫局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长话短说，希望你能配合我的工作，和我一起回龙门，等我们检查完这封信之后再把它寄出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这封信......到底怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这信是一名落网的盗匪头子寄出来的，他说这是他寄给石桥村母亲的家书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们查过了，他确实是石桥村人。顺便，他供出来的第一件案子就是劫了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙从离家起就再没回去过，已经十多年了。考虑到他时日无多，我们也没多作干涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十几年没回过家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他自己说是免得牵连家里人，实际原因......谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧的是，差不多在你出城的同时，我们突然查出他还和其他的案子有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，我们就必须认真考虑这封信不是家书，而是在传递信息的可能性了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......我马上就要送到了。有没有可能是个误会，这真的只是一封普通的家书？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是为了确认这个才一路追着你过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官先生，这里向右走是石桥村，向左走就是我的故乡......那里已经什么都没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石桥村马上也要搬走了。我还知道我的家书该寄到哪里，可这个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不回龙门真的不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，如果你无论如何都不愿先回一趟龙门，我也可以在这里开信检查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但万一这封信里真有什么鬼，或者我出了什么意外，你都是要担责的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那家伙抢过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和案子没关系，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个十几年没回过家，而且再也回不去的人......我愿意相信他寄出的最后一封信只是一封普普通通的家书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那个摄像机能用吗？能用的话麻烦把检查的全过程拍下来，这样我们都好交差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......这封信到底是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人把信规规整整地折好，塞回信封，然后把信封递回我手里，拍了拍我的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它送到它该去的地方吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"我知道山的那边还是山，石桥村的车队出发了也只会和我迎面碰上，但我慢不下来。\n我觉得自己正在赶去见最后一位还没搬家的老邻居。\n到得早些，我们还能一起喝碗茶水，聊聊天。到得晚些，就只能看见背影了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼......赶上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，你是哪位？来给亲戚送行的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是......信使，有一封从龙门寄到石桥村的信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龙门？辛苦你了。给我看一眼信封，我问问已经上了车的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这下不巧了，这封信好像是给赵大娘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不巧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别，姑娘，你别慌，不是你想的那样。赵大娘没事，就是上了岁数，眼花耳背，人也糊涂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前村里人和她说好了，车队一到大家就一起出发，可她现在怎么都不愿走，跟小孩子发脾气似的，说我们骗她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车队首领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这封信，我不知道她还能不能读啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，我先把信交到赵大娘手上吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁？谁来了？谁来我也不走！你们都来骗我！什么移动城市，什么电话，什么城际网络——都来骗我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们就想像骗了二牙似的骗我也走，我不走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是来劝您走的，我是来送信的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不走！打死我也不走，我得在这儿等着......我不爱吃甜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？你怎么进我家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大娘，我是个信使，我来给您送信。您的儿子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识字，被人骗了一辈子......认识又有什么用，二牙认识字，二牙也被骗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这封信应该就是二牙寄给您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信......二牙寄什么信，他从来不给我写信......什么信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这样，我把他的信读给您听，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听......听信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏聩的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铎铃","speakerId":"avg_4083_chimes_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“妈，对不起，十几年了，我没回过家，连一封信也没给你寄过......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"读到最后，我紧紧咬着自己的牙关，不让自己哭出声来。而老人只是转过身，慢吞吞地挪着步子，走进了自家后院。\n小院中央已经有一棵经过精心侍弄的树，上面挂满了枣，青的，红的。\n老人一掌打在枣树的枝叶之间，尖刺划破了她的手，眼泪爬过她布满皱纹的脸。\n片刻的沉默过后，老人转身朝车队的方向走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]}]}
